    {
      "_id": "GS3Qpht1dIMscPx7",
      "name": "Chameleon Skin",
      "type": "physicalTech",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The morph&rsquo;s skin is augmented with complex chromatophores so that it changes color like a chameleon or octopus. Your morph can match the appearance of almost any color and most patterns. Apply a +10 modifier to Infiltrate Tests, +30 if stationary and either nude or wearing smart clothing with the same color/ pattern. This camo does not apply against radar, x-ray, gamma-ray, or infrared heat sensors (including enhanced vision). Alternatively, you can deliberately stand out (+10 to +30 to Perceive Tests to notice) or simply look sharp.</p>",
        "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Edition p. 321",
